5. Left alone on purpose (pre-existing, reported not fixed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * GINE uncertainty artifacts label the GINE ensemble "GIN":
    experiments/uncertainty_ad.py keys the GNN side as "gin" everywhere
    (plot_calibration's hardcoded ("rf","gin") tuple, the calib/ad dict
    keys, the per-molecule CSV "model" column), so for --model gine the
    figures' legend and summary_{tag}_gine.json's "calibration" key read
    gin/GIN even though model_kind says "gine".
  * The AD reference set is train-only:
    experiments/uncertainty_ad.py:544,598 uses sp["train_idx"] and never
    adds sp["valid_idx"], so the max-Tanimoto denominator omits the
    validation molecules the RF was fit on.
